    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n22098" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">impūrĭtas</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">inp-</span></b> ), ātis,
